# The Walls of Your Mind (bastok 69): the offer without the knuckles. HandToHand 2500: 286 (once per zone); its finish with a full
# inventory (no knuckles: giveItem false, not begun); a second talk in the zone falls to the default 230 (oncePerZone:
# priority Ignore); after a rezone 286 again and begun (the knuckles and the guide); then 287 with the knuckles held (hide 1)
# and its option 1 (the knuckles held: nothing).
lists PortBastok/Oggbi/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/286 PortBastok/onEventFinish/287
char zone=PortBastok pos=-159,-7,5 job=MNK lvl=75
quest Bastok.GhostsOfThePast completed    # MNK AF1 (Oggbi's 231) out of the way
quest Bastok.TheFirstMeeting completed    # MNK AF2 (Oggbi's 233) out of the way
skill HandToHand 2500
login
trigger Oggbi                    # 286 (oncePerZone)
fill-inventory
finish                         # no knuckles, the inventory full: giveItem false, not begun
free-inventory
trigger Oggbi                    # 286 already played in this zone: priority Ignore, the default 230
finish
rezone
trigger Oggbi                    # after the rezone: 286 again
finish                         # the knuckles (0 points) and the Weapon Training Guide: accepted
trigger Oggbi                    # the knuckles held: 287 with hide 1
finish option=1                # option 1, the knuckles held: nothing
